                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">10<FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日，初秋之际，丹桂飘香，我校</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1950</FONT><FONT face=宋体>届校友许溶烈院士回访母校，并同一中学子围绕主题“科学报国 筑梦青春”进行了交流座谈</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>。我校王琛校长、孙洪亮副书记</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>热情接待了许院士一行，参观了新校园，介绍了学校近期的各项办学情况和取得的办学成绩。王琛校长代表学校对许溶烈院士的来访表示热烈欢迎，对他在耄耋之年仍然关心母校的事业和发展表示衷心感谢。在交流中，许溶烈院士言语间无不透露着对母校的怀念和感恩之情。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915292872.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915303927.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915313490.jpg" target=_blank> </A><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915315344.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915322784.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915324417.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915324417.jpg" width=6000 onload=resizepic(this) height=4000> </A><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>随后，许溶烈院士同一中学子围绕</FONT>“科学报国 筑梦青春”在树兰楼三楼会议室二进行了亲切交流座谈。在座谈会上，许院士从自己所从事的科技工作谈起，在谈到自己亲身参与的原子弹爆炸、洲际导弹、核潜艇实验时，许院士尤为感触和从容。他反复强调，作为国家的科技工作者，要有家国情怀，更要有责任和担当。机遇是留给有准备的人，作为一中学子要具备适应环境的能力，与人合作至关重要。要努力让自己成为德智体美劳全面发展的人才，实现自己的人生梦想。许院士还与现场学生进行了互动，一中学子就如何对待挫折、如何平衡学习和工作的关系、如何在安逸的环境下学会奋斗等问题纷纷提问，许院士一一作了详细的介绍和解答。许院士指出，实现科技强国的梦想，需要我们每个人的努力。我们既要注重科学理论知识的积累，又要勇于实践，在实践中提出问题，进一步锻炼思维、提高能力。从事科技工作需要有不撞南墙不回头的勇气和信念，需要有锲而不舍的努力和坚持。人才的培养要从最开始抓起，这就要求一中学子要打下良好的基础，以严谨、求真的态度做好基础科学领域的学习和研究。 </SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915340056.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915341555.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915403837.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915403837.jpg" width=1200 onload=resizepic(this) height=800> </A><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020101915355092.jpg" target=_blank> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>交流座谈结束后，许溶烈院士和一中学子合影留念，并为一中寄语题字，寄托对母校的深深眷恋和美好祝福。今天的一中校园，虽小雨淅沥，但因为许院士的到来而显得尤为温暖。前辈的谆谆教导让一中学子们受益匪浅，学长的赤诚相待更让学弟学妹们感动不已。一中学子定不忘科学报国初心，在筑梦青春的道路上奋力而行！</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>许溶烈院士名片</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none" class=MsoNormal align=justify><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>许溶烈，高级工程师。浙江绍兴人，瑞典皇家工程科学院外籍院士。</FONT>1948-1950<FONT face=宋体>年就读于绍兴一中。</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1953</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年毕业于中国南京工学院土木系。</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1956</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年至</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1958</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年初在苏联建筑科学研究院地基与地下构筑物科研所进修。回国后，先后从事科研工作、工地施工工作。</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1972</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年调任国家建工总局科技局副局长，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1982</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年任建设部科技局局长兼中国建筑技术发展中心党委书记兼主任，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1986</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年至</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1994</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年任建设部总工程师，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1994</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年至</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1998</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年任建设部科技委员会副主任，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1998</FONT><FONT face=宋体>年</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>12</FONT><FONT face=宋体>月起任建设部科技委顾问。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
